From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@localhost>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] define _STAT_VER on glibc >= 2.33

glibc 2.33 removed _STAT_VER from its public headers while keeping the
legacy __xstat/__lxstat/__fxstat symbols for ABI compatibility. Define
it as 0 so host fakeroot still builds on newer host distributions.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@localhost>
---
 libfakeroot.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libfakeroot.c b/libfakeroot.c
index b3d7e1f..c4d8e2a 100644
--- a/libfakeroot.c
+++ b/libfakeroot.c
@@ -32,3 +32,7 @@
 #define _GNU_SOURCE
 
+#ifndef _STAT_VER
+# define _STAT_VER 0
+#endif
+
 #define FAKEROOT_LIBFAKEROOT
-- 
2.34.1
